{
    "name": "E2E YouTube - Find and Get Videos",
    "description": "FindVideos searches a public channel, GetVideos loads the first hit by id, MakeApiCall reads the same video through the raw Data API. Needs a Google account consented with the youtube.readonly and youtube.force-ssl scopes.",
    "notes": {
        "a5be5308-1ac6-4637-852b-eef6f63ce801": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 400,
            "width": 704,
            "height": 160,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Account scopes\n\nThe three components use the `appmixer:google` service with YouTube scopes (`youtube.readonly`, `youtube.force-ssl`). A Google account consented only for Drive/Docs fails at flow start with `Access token not found` — connect the account from one of these components so the consent includes the YouTube scopes. The channel `UC_x5XG1OV2P6uZZ5FSM9Ttw` (Google for Developers) is public, so no tenant data is needed."
        }
    },
